First of all, thank you for considering contributing to Tombooru! We're aiming to build a complete archive of all fanart related to the [[Tomba!]] franchise. Every piece helps build our collection and we appreciate your help.

== Quick upload guide ==

Use the form below to upload a new file to the imageboard. Pick a file and then fill out the form below.

All uploads are logged on the [[Special:RecentChanges|Recent Changes]] and [[Special:NewFiles|New Files]] pages. Before uploading, make sure to check out the [[Special:Tombooru/page/Help/Content_guide|content guide]]. Not sure how to tag your post? The [[Special:Tombooru/page/Help/How_to_tag|how to tag]] page can help. And, of course, you could look at other posts and generally copy what they do.

You can always edit all of this information later on, after your upload has gone through.

Please try to upload images in as high quality as possible. If you're not sure how to grab the highest quality image from a particular website, ask around on [https://discord.com/invite/zx45UfVP5t Discord] and we'll help you out.
